# The paths whose pull requests wait for pgoell's review: CI and the review
# itself, deploy and containers, agent settings, migrations, auth, and the
# dependency files. Branch protection requires a code owner's approval, which no
# workflow can forge, and GitHub reads this file from the base branch, so a pull
# request cannot take itself off the list. A push dismisses the approval.
